ちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いますねえ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s really different from what I expected.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">まるで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰如；就像；好像；仿佛；宛如；毫；丝毫；一点儿（多用于否定句）；完全；彻底；十分；真正</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158843\">まるで<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ているようだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I feel as if I were dreaming.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まるまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">圆润；丰满；肥胖；完全；彻底；全部</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186920\"><ruby>家畜<rp>(</rp><rt>かちく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はみんなまるまるしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Their cattle are all fat.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まるめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">使圆；卷起；蜷起；诱哄；哄骗；搪塞；四舍五入；剃头；剃光头发；混为一谈；笼统地归并</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192712\">より<ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には、<ruby>体<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>丸<rp>(</rp><rt>まる</rt><rp>)</rp></ru